  ┌ Launch harness in new mux ───────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │► mux name       adhoc                                          [ ] socket│
  │  harness        claude-code      [claude-code] [codex] [opencode]        │
  │  options        [ ] skip permissions                                     │
  │  cwd            /tmp                      √                              │
  │  launch argv    -                                                        │
  │  └ command      claude                                                   │
  │  worktree       [ ] no worktree                                          │
  │  pin            [x] don't pin [ ] launch, then pin [ ] pin, don't launch │
  │                                                                          │
  │↑/↓ move · Tab complete/next · S-Tab back · ←/→/Space option              │
  │Enter launch · Esc cancel                                                 │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
